description:
In patients not taking CYP2D6 inhibitors. Note: no alleles or diplotype frequencies reported. Pre (79.5%) and post (20.5%) menopausal woman taking adjuvant tamoxifen (20mg/day) for a median duration of 12 month. 88% took at at least one other medication in addition to tamoxifen. CYP2D6 *3, *4, *5, *9, *10, and *41 were tested using TaqMan assays. Intermediate alleles were defined as *9, *10, and *41; and CYP2D6 poor alleles as *3, *4, and *5. EMs (UM/EM and EM/EM);
IMs (EM/IM, EM/PM, IM/IM, and IM/PM); and PMs (PM/
PM) [pre-menopausal] [post-menopausal] [adjuvant] [DNA source: blood]

